[{"title":"Top of page","items":[{"id":"name","kind":"Service name","value":"Branding and design"},{"id":"short","kind":"Short name","value":"Branding"},{"id":"blurb","kind":"One-line summary (services page)","value":"Logo, identity, packaging and the system that keeps a company looking like one company."},{"id":"h1","kind":"Headline","value":"A brand that looks"},{"id":"roll.0","kind":"Rotating word 1","value":"like one company."},{"id":"roll.1","kind":"Rotating word 2","value":"the same everywhere."},{"id":"roll.2","kind":"Rotating word 3","value":"worth the price."},{"id":"lead","kind":"Intro","value":"Logo, identity, packaging and the rules that hold them together. We design the brand, then use it on the site, the ads and the feed, so it never drifts."},{"id":"backdrop","kind":"Background picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-vaishnodevi-3bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"stage.items.0.0","kind":"Hero photo 1 picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-south-bopal-3bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"stage.items.0.1","kind":"Hero photo 1 description","value":"Highmark Realty launch ad, South Bopal"},{"id":"stage.items.1.0","kind":"Hero photo 2 picture","value":"/media/naarie/founder-nayna-surti.jpg","image":true},{"id":"stage.items.1.1","kind":"Hero photo 2 description","value":"Naarie founder creative"},{"id":"stage.items.2.0","kind":"Hero photo 3 picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-zundal-2bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"stage.items.2.1","kind":"Hero photo 3 description","value":"Highmark Realty launch ad, Zundal"},{"id":"card.0.0","kind":"At a glance 1 label","value":"Includes"},{"id":"card.0.1","kind":"At a glance 1 text","value":"Logo, identity, packaging and templates"},{"id":"card.1.0","kind":"At a glance 2 label","value":"Used on"},{"id":"card.1.1","kind":"At a glance 2 text","value":"Website, ads, social and print"},{"id":"card.2.0","kind":"At a glance 3 label","value":"Delivered as"},{"id":"card.2.1","kind":"At a glance 3 text","value":"Final files and a short guide your team can follow"}]},{"title":"The problem","items":[{"id":"statement","kind":"Problem statement","value":"Most brands do not fail at the logo. They fail on the fiftieth post, when nobody remembers which orange it was. We design the system, then we use it."},{"id":"statementCta","kind":"Line before the buttons","value":"Does your brand look different everywhere?"}]},{"title":"What you get","items":[{"id":"includes.eyebrow","kind":"Small label","value":"What you get"},{"id":"includes.h2","kind":"Heading","value":"A system, not just a logo"},{"id":"includes.items.0.0","kind":"Point 1 title","value":"Logo and identity"},{"id":"includes.items.0.1","kind":"Point 1 text","value":"A mark, colours and type that work at the size of an Instagram icon and the size of a hoarding."},{"id":"includes.items.1.0","kind":"Point 2 title","value":"A guide people open"},{"id":"includes.items.1.1","kind":"Point 2 text","value":"A short guide your team will actually use. Colours, fonts, spacing, do and do not."},{"id":"includes.items.2.0","kind":"Point 3 title","value":"Packaging and print"},{"id":"includes.items.2.1","kind":"Point 3 text","value":"Boxes, labels, cards and brochures, designed to sit together on a shelf."},{"id":"includes.items.3.0","kind":"Point 4 title","value":"Social and ad templates"},{"id":"includes.items.3.1","kind":"Point 4 text","value":"Post and ad layouts built on the brand, so every creative looks related."},{"id":"includes.items.4.0","kind":"Point 5 title","value":"Applied, not filed away"},{"id":"includes.items.4.1","kind":"Point 5 text","value":"We also build the site and run the ads, so the brand gets used the way it was designed."},{"id":"includes.cta","kind":"Line before the buttons","value":"Want a brand that holds together?"}]},{"title":"Proof","items":[{"id":"proof.eyebrow","kind":"Small label","value":"Proof"},{"id":"proof.h2","kind":"Heading","value":"Same brand, every place it shows up"},{"id":"proof.gallery.0.0","kind":"Gallery 1 picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-sp-ring-road-3bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"proof.gallery.0.1","kind":"Gallery 1 description","value":"Highmark Realty ad, SP Ring Road"},{"id":"proof.gallery.1.0","kind":"Gallery 2 picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-vaishnodevi-3bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"proof.gallery.1.1","kind":"Gallery 2 description","value":"Highmark Realty ad, Vaishnodevi"},{"id":"proof.gallery.2.0","kind":"Gallery 3 picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-zundal-2bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"proof.gallery.2.1","kind":"Gallery 3 description","value":"Highmark Realty ad, Zundal"},{"id":"proof.gallery.3.0","kind":"Gallery 4 picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/ad-south-bopal-3bhk.jpg","image":true},{"id":"proof.gallery.3.1","kind":"Gallery 4 description","value":"Highmark Realty ad, South Bopal"},{"id":"proof.cases.0.client","kind":"Case 1 › Client","value":"Highmark Realty"},{"id":"proof.cases.0.href","kind":"Case 1 › Link","value":"/work-highmark-realty","link":true},{"id":"proof.cases.0.img","kind":"Case 1 › Picture","value":"/media/highmark-realty/founder-ashirwad-shukla.jpg","image":true},{"id":"proof.cases.0.alt","kind":"Case 1 › Picture description","value":"Highmark Realty founder creative"},{"id":"proof.cases.0.line","kind":"Case 1 › Summary","value":"Every launch ad follows one layout. Plan, price, location and number, in the same order and the same style. A buyer knows it is Highmark before reading a word."},{"id":"proof.cases.1.client","kind":"Case 2 › Client","value":"Naarie"},{"id":"proof.cases.1.href","kind":"Case 2 › Link","value":"/work-naarie","link":true},{"id":"proof.cases.1.img","kind":"Case 2 › Picture","value":"/media/naarie/site-home.webp","image":true},{"id":"proof.cases.1.alt","kind":"Case 2 › Picture description","value":"Naarie website home page"},{"id":"proof.cases.1.line","kind":"Case 2 › Summary","value":"The site, the feed and the ads are run by the same team. A bride sees the same work and the same prices wherever she finds Naarie. Nothing contradicts anything."},{"id":"proof.cta","kind":"Line before the buttons","value":"Want your brand to hold together like this?"}]},{"title":"How it works","items":[{"id":"process.h2","kind":"Heading","value":"How a brand comes together"},{"id":"process.steps.0.0","kind":"Step 1 title","value":"Listen"},{"id":"process.steps.0.1","kind":"Step 1 text","value":"Who you sell to, what you charge and who you are up against."},{"id":"process.steps.1.0","kind":"Step 2 title","value":"Directions"},{"id":"process.steps.1.1","kind":"Step 2 text","value":"A small number of routes, shown on real things. A post, a bill, a sign."},{"id":"process.steps.2.0","kind":"Step 3 title","value":"Refine"},{"id":"process.steps.2.1","kind":"Step 3 text","value":"One direction taken to finished, with your feedback built in."},{"id":"process.steps.3.0","kind":"Step 4 title","value":"Hand over and apply"},{"id":"process.steps.3.1","kind":"Step 4 text","value":"Files, guide and templates. Then we put it to work on the site and the ads, if you want."},{"id":"process.cta","kind":"Line before the buttons","value":"Start with a conversation."}]},{"title":"Questions","items":[{"id":"faq.0.0","kind":"Question 1 question","value":"Do you only design logos?"},{"id":"faq.0.1","kind":"Question 1 answer","value":"We can, but a logo alone rarely fixes the problem. The system around it is what keeps a business looking consistent."},{"id":"faq.1.0","kind":"Question 2 question","value":"Can you refresh our brand instead of replacing it?"},{"id":"faq.1.1","kind":"Question 2 answer","value":"Often that is the better choice. If people already recognise you, we keep what works and fix what does not."},{"id":"faq.2.0","kind":"Question 3 question","value":"Do we get the files?"},{"id":"faq.2.1","kind":"Question 3 answer","value":"Yes. You get the final files to keep, along with the guide and templates."},{"id":"faq.3.0","kind":"Question 4 question","value":"Do you design packaging?"},{"id":"faq.3.1","kind":"Question 4 answer","value":"Yes. Boxes, labels and print, designed to sit with the rest of the brand."}]},{"title":"Closing","items":[{"id":"end.h2","kind":"Heading","value":"Let us see what you have now"},{"id":"end.p","kind":"Text","value":"Send us your logo, your feed and your website. We will tell you where the brand is drifting, before you pay us anything."},{"id":"waText","kind":"WhatsApp message","value":"Hi Digitorium, I want to talk about branding and design."}]}]
